{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/381094-rage-across-the-heavens-in-werewolf","id":381094,"title":"Rage Across the Heavens In Werewolf","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-25T10:16:56-08:00","id":381094,"title":"Rage Across the Heavens In Werewolf","content":"Long question made short: how would you guys go about handling the Planetary Incarnae and heavenly spirits if you were converting them to Forsaken? Do you think that Earthly perceptions of space would influence spirits of the planets and starts in any way?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T10:48:26-08:00","id":381179,"title":"","content":"The Warden Moon keeps those louts off our doorstep <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> There is a Boundary with a capital B, and to cross that Boundary you have to deal with the Bouncer, and the Bouncer is an insane moon.<br /> <br /> To actually answer your question, no, I don't think Earthly perceptions of space and the planets would influence any spirits of such, if the Shadow of such regions even follows laws anything like that of the terrestrial Shadow. It's not the Astral; those spirits, if they exist, do so entirely independently of humanity and the Resonance it generates.<br /> <br /> At least until some sods started flinging space probes and various wavelengths of data around the place, anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T11:01:35-08:00","id":381186,"title":"","content":"Huh I always thought they'd be at least partially influenced, with the worship and linking them to gods and all, Mars being angry, Venus being amorous, Neptune being wet. And some things like Saturn having a ring. Maybe that would just be more of an earthbound spirit of the planets, a sort of perception of them you might find in planetariums, that I suppose don't get gobbled up by their namesakes because Luna keeps them separate.<br /> <br /> I was going to suggest looking to Mage, as I know they have a legacy (entitlement? the mage version of lodges and bloodlines) that can give them Status among planets, the Thrice-Great or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T13:19:30-08:00","id":381304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/381094-rage-across-the-heavens-in-werewolf#post381094\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Long question made short: how would you guys go about handling the Planetary Incarnae and heavenly spirits if you were converting them to Forsaken? Do you think that Earthly perceptions of space would influence spirits of the planets and starts in any way?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Like the example from Lunes and Helions. Grab some astrology books and study the Heavenly Bodies thru those lenses as you arrange a court for them, and how they relate to each other. They, most likely, have sacred metals, not unlike Helios and Luna do, for instance. Mars spirits will universally be masculine, contrary to Venus spirits. Etc, Etc, Etc.<br /> <br /> Keep in mind that the thing we get from those bodies is their light. We can't touch them, much like Lunes and Helions are beings of light as well, or the lack of thereoff (looking at Irralunim), their aspects were given form from our own perceptions and the mythologies we attached them.<br /> <br /> The point is... you have to make your players healthly wonder if our perceptions molded the spirits... or if it was their influence what made us attach those meanings to them. It's the classic Shadow dichotomy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":576,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","user":"Ephsy","date":". 01-25-2015, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}